      "ArrowRightIcon": "Material ArrowForward",
      "ArrowLeftCircleIcon": "Material ArrowCircleLeft",
      "PlusIcon": "Material Add",
      "Spinner": "existing shared decorative Spinner SVG"
    },
    "markers": "The Small Outline cell in Create Icon Right has no data-icon and retains ordinary padding. Downloading has a trailing spinner with inline-start marker and therefore reduces logical-start padding. Other custom inline icons reduce their marked logical edge to6DIP at xs/sm or8DIP at default/lg.",
    "localActions": "Source action buttons record Local button action; source anchors record Local button link. No submission, filesystem, authentication or network effects are simulated. Per-recipe action/counter values survive configuration changes and page return.",
    "theme": "Menu style changes the configuration and language pickers only. Source button/link targets always use native MyGo input/AX and the kit theme. No new font/icon-font/assets/dependencies.",
